From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iscle <albertiscle9@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:43:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] camera: Bypass roundBufferDimensionNearest for implementation
 defined streams

Used by the preview, live photo and zoom map streams of the Xiaomi 15
(dada) stock camera. They use sizes from the vendor stream
configuration map, and rounding them to the public map changes their
aspect ratio, which crashes the camera provider.

Change-Id: I7dd7e03eb1486bf78e643bd1ffb9bc87bc795625
---
 .../libcameraservice/utils/SessionConfigurationUtils.cpp       | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/services/camera/libcameraservice/utils/SessionConfigurationUtils.cpp b/services/camera/libcameraservice/utils/SessionConfigurationUtils.cpp
index 7cbf6995e8..84eca152c9 100644
--- a/services/camera/libcameraservice/utils/SessionConfigurationUtils.cpp
+++ b/services/camera/libcameraservice/utils/SessionConfigurationUtils.cpp
@@ -240,7 +240,8 @@ bool roundBufferDimensionNearest(int32_t width, int32_t height,
     // those are not populated in static capabilities.
     if (isPriviledgedClient == true &&
             (format == HAL_PIXEL_FORMAT_YCbCr_420_888 || format == HAL_PIXEL_FORMAT_BLOB ||
-             format == HAL_PIXEL_FORMAT_Y8 || format == HAL_PIXEL_FORMAT_Y16)) {
+             format == HAL_PIXEL_FORMAT_Y8 || format == HAL_PIXEL_FORMAT_Y16 ||
+             format == HAL_PIXEL_FORMAT_IMPLEMENTATION_DEFINED)) {
         ALOGI("Bypass roundBufferDimensionNearest for privilegedClient YUV streams "
                 "width %d height %d for format %d", width, height, format);
 
